1
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,730
杰
Jay.

2
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:06,460
-杰... -怎么
- Jay... -What?!

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,620
-什么事 -你在打鼾
- What's wrong? - You are snoring!

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,640
我吗 对不起
Me? Oh, I'm sorry.

5
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,320
看我家小宝贝
Look at her!

6
00:00:16,031 --> 00:00:19,040
拜托 说好了不许斯黛拉上床
Come on! We said no Stella in the bed.

7
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,580
狗狗还小呢
Oh but she's just a little puppy.

8
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,914
她八成是害怕了 偷偷躲进我怀里
She probably get scared and snuck in.

9
00:00:22,914 --> 00:00:24,940
是吗 那为什么曼尼做噩梦的时候
Oh really? How come when Manny have nightmares

10
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,440
你不准他溜上床
you don't let him snuck in bed?

11
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,740
歌洛莉亚 现在才早晨六点
Gloria, it's six o'clock in the morning,

12
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,900
咱能待会再讨论这个问题吗
can we talk about this later?

13
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:32,360
请正面回答她的问题 杰
Answer the question, Jay.

14
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,500
我去查一查租赁合同
You know, I'm gonna check the lease,

15
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,520
但我很确信我们不能开个冰毒作坊
but I'm pretty sure we're not allowed to have a meth lab.

16
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,800
你真幽默
You are a delight.

17
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,060
那你这是在做什么
So what are you doing?

18
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:44,580
我觉得你会喜欢的 我要进行"果汁速度减肥法"
I think you're gonna like this. I'm going on a juice fast.

19
00:00:45,501 --> 00:00:46,580
我爱死了
Mmm. Love it.

20
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,620
讨厌死了 面对现实吧
Hate it. Let's face it,

21
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:52,200
肚大腰圆的小卡原本就容易情绪失控
A well-fed Cam is hardly a model of emotional stability.

22
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,520
一旦断粮 阶段性地往下发展
Now deprive him of food, and stage by stage,

23
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:57,480
他便缓缓驶入疯狂的境地
it's a slow descent into madness.

24
00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:00,407
阶段一 大清扫
Stage one--the clean sweep.

25
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:01,000
毒货
Poison.

26
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:02,680
毒货
Poison.

27
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:06,840
-毒货啊 -你觉得这周节食合适吗
- Poison. - Do you think that this is the best week to be doing this?

28
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,460
怎么不合适
Why not?

29
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:09,940
-我们要去我老板家参加慈善晚会 -那又怎样
- Well, we have that charity thing at my boss' house. - Oh, so what,

30
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:11,580
我想追求健康生活
I'm supposed to put off my quest for wellness

31
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:13,240
还必须等到咱俩没有应酬吗
until we're no longer socially in demand?

32
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,340
我人见人爱 没应酬是不可能的
That will never happen. I'm too charismatic.

33
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:17,080
不 别扔饼干
No. No. Not the cookies.

34
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:19,000
饼干扔立决
Of course the cookies.

35
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,620
你干嘛总希望我减肥失败
Why do you always want me to fail?

36
00:01:21,630 --> 00:01:23,980
阶段二 拿米奇尔撒气
Stage two--attack Mitchell.

37
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:26,820
一旦他经不住能多益巧克力酱的诱惑
Because when his diet crashes and burns

38
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:28,860
减肥计划流产
into a giant pile of nutella,

39
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,500
就把错全怪到我身上
I'm the one he's gonna blame.

40
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:32,400
不 这回可不行
Well, no, not this time.

41
00:01:32,540 --> 00:01:34,620
这样 我决定和你一起减
You know what? I'm gonna do the fast with you.

42
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:36,880
减肥计划很棒 我们应该一起执行
I think it's a great idea, and we should do it together.

43
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:39,800
我们齐心协力 夫夫齐心战美食
So we're on the same team, you know, us versus food.

44
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,960
你的心思我一清二楚
I know what you're doing...

45
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,800
我真的很感动
and I really appreciate it.

46
00:01:44,579 --> 00:01:46,420
不 那将对我也有好处
No, it'll-- it'll be good for me.

47
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,900
我最近也重了几磅
I've actually put on a few pounds.

48
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:50,197
是啊 之前我都不好意思开口说你肥了
Yeah, well, you know, I didn't want to say anything.

49
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,600
尽管各大股指直线下滑
As the stock market plummeted,

50
00:01:57,660 --> 00:02:00,400
勇敢的年轻人仍不畏高空
brave young men took to the skies,

51
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:04,440
引领我们进入勇敢无畏的黄金年代
ushering in the golden age of the daredevil.

52
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,060
可敬的人类
How awesome are people?

53
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:07,920
真可敬
So awesome.

54
00:02:10,093 --> 00:02:12,072
去开门吧 伙计 我按暂停了
You wanna get that, buddy? I'll pause it.

55
00:02:13,532 --> 00:02:15,500
-卢克 还好吗 -好啊 米奇尔舅舅
- Hey, Luke. How's it going? I-- - Hey, uncle Mitchell.

56
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,520
我真没时间闲聊 正在看电影呢
I really can't talk. I'm trying to watch a movie.

57
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:20,520
好吧 我只是把这袋垃圾食品拿过来
Oh, okay, well, I just wanted to drop off this bag of junk food.

58
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:21,940
继续说
Go on.

59
00:02:22,540 --> 00:02:25,060
小卡和我在实行"果汁速度减肥法"
Uh, Cam and I are on a juice fast,

60
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,620
所以美食放在家里...
so having this stuff in the house--

61
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:28,960
我懂了 再见
I connected the dots. See ya.

62
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:38,080
看到那位年轻的钢丝奇人
Seeing that weird, wonderful little man

63
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:41,680
精彩的寻梦之旅 我不禁在想
pursuing his dream of walking on a tightrope made me think

64
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,380
或许我也该追求自己的梦想
maybe I could pursue my dream...

65
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:44,640
拿好了 伙计
Here you go, buddy.

66
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,840
我也要走钢丝
of walking on a tightrope.

67
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:06,480
加油 老爸 你行的 你可以的
Come on, dad! You got this! You can do this!

68
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:07,940
全神贯注 保持冲劲
Stay focused! Stay hungry!

69
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:08,760
没事吧 伙计
You okay, buddy?

70
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,280
什么 当然没事
What? Yeah, hell, yeah, no.

71
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,300
就是为我老爹感到自豪
Just proud of my dad!

72
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:14,140
那袋子里有好多巧克力
There was a lot of chocolate in that bag.

73
00:03:14,961 --> 00:03:18,480
菲尔 亲爱的 该送卢克上学了
Phil, honey, you gotta take Luke to school.

74
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,040
好的
Got it.

75
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:22,380
好的 刚才4次里有3次没掉下来
Okay, I haven't fallen three out of the last four times.

76
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,600
今天下午 咱要悬空踩了
This afternoon, we go airborne.

77
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:35,980
孤零零一个人坐在桌前
Sitting all by yourself at the table.

78
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:37,800
这一幕似曾相识啊
Now where have I seen that again?

79
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:40,220
对了 每天在学校自助餐厅都看到
Oh, right. Every day in the school cafeteria.

80
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,140
我选择一个人坐的
I do that by choice.

81
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:43,220
是校友们选择冷落你吧
The school's choice.

82
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:43,980
你的绰号就是"校选之花"吧
Isn't that your nickname?

83
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:45,860
海莉 对妹妹友善点
Haley, be nice to your sister.

84
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:47,440
艾丽克斯 回得好
Alex, good save.

85
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:49,580
妈妈 签个字
Mom, sign this.

86
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,280
这是什么
What is it?

87
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,480
校方终于准我升入中级数学班了
They finally bumped me up to the harder math class.

88
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,760
高中数学第三期 沃特斯老师教
Third period, Mr. Waters.

89
00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:55,880
什么 不 妈妈 你不能签
What? No, mom, you cannot sign this.

90
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:56,840
我在那个班上课
This is my class.

91
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:59,120
你才高一 学高二数学太早了吧
You're a freshman. What are you doing in second-year math?

92
00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:01,700
你都高三了 干嘛还赖在高二数学班里不走
You're a senior. What are you still doing in second year math?

93
00:04:01,780 --> 00:04:03,260
不是赖着不走 姐是重修
Not "Still." "Again."

94
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:05,160
艾丽克斯 别对姐姐那么刻薄
Alex, be nice to your sister.

95
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,320
海莉 回得不行
Haley, not a good save.

96
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,280
就知道和你同校肯定受打击
I knew it would suck having you at my school.

97
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,300
你估计得忍耐一下
Well, hang in there.

98
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:11,980
再过几年 留在学校的又是你一人了
A couple more years, you'll have it all to yourself again.

99
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:12,780
走吧 姑娘们
Come on, girls.

100
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,920
杰 看她干得好事
Jay, look at this.

101
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:19,980
全毁了
It's ruined.

102
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:22,020
斯黛拉干的 她啃我的鞋
Stella did this. She chew on my shoe!

103
00:04:22,020 --> 00:04:23,760
那只笨狗欠管教
You have to discipline that stupid dog.

104
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,140
我经常管教她的
I discipline her all the time.

105
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,340
真的吗 怎么管的 赏她吃纸杯蛋糕吗
Oh, really? How? By buying her little cupcakes?

106
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:28,520
那不算纸杯蛋糕
They're not real cupcakes.

107
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,720
那是狗狗奖励 用纸杯蛋糕形式发放
They're doggy treats in the form of cupcakes.

108
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:33,380
你该在曼尼误食之前告诉他的
Yeah, you should have told that to Manny before he ate one.

109
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:35,040
没关系 他现在可是皮光水滑啊
Oh, come on. His coat never looked better.

110
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:39,240
要是她把你的鞋啃成这样 看你还乐不乐
You wouldn't find it so funny if she was destroying your shoes.

111
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:41,880
我从不乱扔鞋子 也就不会...
Well, I don't leave my shoes laying around, so...

112
00:04:41,900 --> 00:04:44,960
这么说鞋子挨啃是我自作自受了
So it's my fault that she chooses to chew my shoe?

113
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:47,240
我没这么说 这可是你自己说的
I didn't say that. You barely said it.

114
00:04:47,252 --> 00:04:49,000
你不能再这么宠着她了
You have to stop coddling her.

115
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,620
我没宠着她
I don't coddle her.

116
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:54,380
干嘛
What?

117
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:58,000
她在喝我的洗澡水呢
She tries to drink the water.

118
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,180
可逗了
It's funny.

119
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:03,440
上课的时候不许看我 也不许给我发短信
You don't look at me in class. You don't text me.

120
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:05,420
谁会上课的时候发短信啊
Who would text during a class?

121
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,780
你真是个怪胎
What are you?

122
00:05:07,791 --> 00:05:10,940
亲爱的 我知道现在这个情况
Hon, I realize that this situation is not ideal

123
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:11,840
对你们两个都不理想
for either one of you,

124
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:15,040
但有时候 逆境出人才嘛
but sometimes we just rise above things. Yes?

125
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,860
打扰一下 你注意到了路缘是黄色的吗
Excuse me. Did you notice the curb here is painted yellow?

126
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:20,360
没 我没注意
Uh, no, I did not.

127
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:23,060
奇怪了 这代表"上下车区域"
Wow. It means loading and unloading.

128
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:25,400
好吧 我就停一小会 让她们下车
Okay, well, I was just dropping off my kids.

129
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,600
我怎么还没看见有人下车呢
And yet I see no kids emerging from the vehicle.

130
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,840
我们在聊天
Well, we were chatting.

131
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:33,620
不怕惊着您 长官
At the risk of surprising you a third time, officer,

132
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:35,112
我这么停车已经好几年了
I've been dropping off here for years, and I--

133
00:05:35,112 --> 00:05:36,700
-开走 -没问题
- Move it. - Okay. You betcha.

134
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:38,220
她有毛病吧
What was her problem?

135
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:40,160
我教你 你该这么回她...
Oh, you know what you should have said to her--

136
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:42,380
什么都不说最好 我不回嘴
Nothing. I should have said nothing would be the point.

137
00:05:42,420 --> 00:05:43,460
我们抬头不见低头见
I have to see her every day.

138
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,580
何必把事情搞得那么僵呢
I mean, why make it worse?

139
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,420
我想表达的就是这个意思
That's exactly what I'm talking about.

140
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,300
人生不如意事十有八九
Awkward, unpleasant situation--

141
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:49,540
逆境成功
rise above.

142
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:52,100
过得愉快
Have a nice day.

143
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:53,860
爱你们哟
Love you!

144
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:55,868
拜拜
Bye-bye!

145
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,340
"我怎么还没看见有人下车呢"
"And yet I see no children emerging from the vehicle."

146
00:06:03,340 --> 00:06:06,030
再啰嗦 赏你一记粉拳看看
How'd you like to see my fist emerging into your face?

147
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:09,280
我怎么这么暴力
Oh! Now I think of it!

148
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:13,000
"果汁速度减肥法"的第四天
Day four of the juice fast,

149
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,953
我很饿 但是感觉很好
and I'm hungry, but I'm-- I'm feeling pretty good.

150
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,820
可是小卡 已经
Cam, on the other hand, has gone all...

151
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:20,220
边缘精神错乱了
"Girl, Interrupted."

152
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,640
继阶段一 食物大清扫
After one, throwing out all of our food,

153
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,160
和阶段二 拿我撒气
and two, blaming me,

154
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:27,640
他进入了第三阶段 肥皂剧女王
he entered stage three-- soap actress.

155
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:30,700
真希望我的傻妹妹多为自己想想
I just wish my sister would put herself out there more.

156
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:32,620
她如此多才多艺
She has so much to offer.

157
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:35,400
为何男人都如此肤浅
Why are men so superficial?

158
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:39,200
随之而来的是第四阶段
That was followed by stage four--

159
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:40,520
间歇性中邪
a rush of epiphanies...

160
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:43,460
我 不 需 要 食 物
I... Don't... Need... Food.

161
00:06:43,588 --> 00:06:46,613
看啊 到处都是别致的建筑
Look at this. Architecture is everywhere.

162
00:06:46,762 --> 00:06:49,138
西班牙的运动健将层出不穷
Oh. Spaniards make amazing athletes.

163
00:06:49,202 --> 00:06:52,259
接下来是第五阶段 绝望主夫
Into stage five--despair...

164
00:06:53,846 --> 00:06:58,565
爹地 我们藏好了 但是你没来找我们
Daddy, we hided, but you didn't seek.

165
00:06:59,140 --> 00:06:59,620
小卡
Cam?

166
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,480
然后是狂躁状态
Then came rage.

167
00:07:08,453 --> 00:07:10,140
手里拿的啥啊
Hey. Whatcha got there?

168
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:11,360
好消息是
The good news is,

169
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:15,440
小卡从来没坚持过这么久
Cam's never made it this far into a diet before, so...

170
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:17,940
坏消息是 我对下一阶段会怎样一无所知
Downside--I have no idea what the next stage is gonna be.

171
00:07:18,860 --> 00:07:19,800
但是我可以肯定
But I'm pretty sure

172
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,320
他此时的状态不适合参加派对
it's not charming party guest.

173
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:23,140
小卡 我在考虑
Cam, I-I was thinking,

174
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:25,420
明晚我独身赴会 接受老板的摧残吧
I'll take the bullet tomorrow night at my boss' house.

175
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:27,020
你不必去参加的
You don't have to go to the party.

176
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,867
那些人特无聊
They're--they're boring.

177
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,420
还净做傻事 人也多
Silly cause, you know, lots of people.

178
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,360
车位也紧张
Parking...

179
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:39,540
-小卡 好歹说句话啊 -你为何如此恨我
- Cam, say something. - Why do you hate me?

180
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,640
我不恨你啊
I don't hate you.

181
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:42,400
那为什么要把我驱逐出你的生活
Then why are you trying to push me out of your life?

182
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:45,547
因为你看起来 有点
Because you--you seem a little...

183
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:47,420
精神错乱
unhinged.

184
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,900
知道我在想什么吗
Okay, well, you know what I think?

185
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,340
你应该少操我的心
You should worry a little bit less about me

186
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:51,880
多操心你自己
and a little bit more about yourself

187
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:52,980
想想明晚穿什么吧
and what you're gonna wear tomorrow night,

188
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:54,520
我看到了你选的那套了
because I saw what you have laid out,

189
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:57,120
要是穿那套拍照 你一定悔不当初
and I don't think you're gonna like the way you look in photos.

190
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:00,820
我没决定穿那套啊
Well, I hadn't landed on that.

191
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,920
她几乎五秒钟就要举一次手
Her hand's in the air, like, every five seconds,

192
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,880
还主动提醒沃特斯先生布置家庭作业
and she actually reminded Mr. Waters to assign homework.

193
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:10,340
同学怨声载道 你知道我有多尴尬吗
The class loved that. Do you know how embarrassed I was?

194
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:11,740
没有我尴尬
Not as embarrassed as I was

195
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:14,780
她说8是质数 8唉 妈妈
when she said 8 was a prime number. 8, mom.

196
00:08:14,780 --> 00:08:16,080
行了 你们听着
Okay, fine. You know what?

197
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:19,020
我今天就给学校打电话 把你们课表换掉
I'm gonna call the school today and have your schedules changed,

198
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:22,400
但是你们要知道 我今天很失望
but I want you to know a little part of me died today, okay?

199
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,700
我还以为你们能明白
I thought the two of you could understand

200
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:27,040
姐妹同班对你们都有好处
how being in the same class would benefit you both.

201
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,882
艾丽克斯 你可以辅导海莉的功课
Alex, you--you could've tutored Haley.

202
00:08:28,882 --> 00:08:32,117
海莉 你可以教艾丽克斯交往之道
Haley, you could've helped alex with her social skills.

203
00:08:32,117 --> 00:08:35,822
拜托 你们本该成为超级邓菲无敌档
Come on. The two of you could've been two Super Dunphys.

204
00:08:35,822 --> 00:08:39,200
但现在呢 你们像什么样 邓菲反目吵嘴王
And instead, what are you? Two bickering Half-Dunphys,

205
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,840
我真是痴人说梦才对你们抱期望
and I'm the fool that expected more.

206
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:45,709
停 我不想听 给我上楼去
No, I don't even want to hear it. Just go upstairs. Go.

207
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:49,860
这唱的是哪一出啊
What was that?

208
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:53,360
虎妈独家育儿经
That was a master class in parenting.

209
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:55,720
现在我们的女儿在楼上
Right now our daughters are upstairs

210
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:58,120
自以为是地做着决定
making a decision they think is their own,

211
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:00,740
但实际上 都是我巧妙植入的潜意识
But really, it was an idea that was skillfully implanted by me.

212
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:02,620
成盗梦师啦 克莱尔
Inception, Claire.

213
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,120
玩的就是心跳 我很喜欢
Dangerous game, but I like it.

214
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,160
那是什么
What are those?

215
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,280
走钢丝专用鞋
Wire walkers.

216
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:15,140
所谓工欲善其事 必先利其器
You want to go to the dance, you gotta wear the shoes.

217
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:16,640
带上照相机 卢克
Luke, grab your camera.

218
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:19,700
卢克
Luke.

219
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:21,640
我没睡着
I wasn't sleeping.

220
00:09:23,411 --> 00:09:26,740
亲爱的 那好像是...
Honey, I-I think those are...

221
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:27,680
爵士舞鞋
Jazz shoes.

222
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,085
不是 是钢丝鞋
No. Tightrope shoes.

223
00:09:29,085 --> 00:09:31,924
别人搬家大拍卖时买下的 只穿过一次
Got 'em at an estate sale. Only worn once.

224
00:09:31,924 --> 00:09:33,700
那可不适合...
That--that is not a ringing endorsement for...

225
00:09:33,710 --> 00:09:36,098
菲尔 亲爱的
Oh! Phil, honey.

226
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,509
拜托 小心点
Please be ca--careful. Right.

227
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,520
小心别撞门
Watch the door.

228
00:09:43,741 --> 00:09:45,280
你第三题答案多少
Hey, what'd you get for number 3?

229
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:48,020
如果我直接告诉你答案 你就学不到东西了
You're not going to learn if I just give you answers.

230
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,680
那如果我给你一点回报呢
Well, what if I gave you something in return?

231
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:51,860
比如什么
Like what?

232
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:54,020
你在班上可以跟我讲话
You can talk to me in class.

233
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,660
午餐时间 我要和你们人气王坐一桌
I want lunch at the cool table.

234
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,300
那我要所有题的答案
Then I want all the answers.

235
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,800
延续一周午餐同坐
Then I want a week at the table.

236
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,760
-两次测试答案 -一个月
- That'll cost you two pop quizzes. -A month.

237
00:10:04,820 --> 00:10:05,900
-外加期中考试 -成交
-The midterm. -Deal.

238
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:08,480
老爸 挺有范啊
Looking great, dad.

239
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:13,480
走出这几步 我就打破了束缚
With these steps, I break the surly bonds...

240
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,120
上帝保佑
Chicken in a basket!

241
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:19,900
别拍我
Don't look at me.

242
00:10:19,934 --> 00:10:21,991
-老妈 老妈 -怎么了 怎么了
- Mom. Mom. Mom. -What? What? What? What? What?

243
00:10:22,026 --> 00:10:24,334
妈妈 你打电话给学校了吗
Mom. Mom. Did you call the school yet?

244
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:26,160
还没呢 我正准备打
Uh, not yet, but I was just about to.

245
00:10:26,191 --> 00:10:27,686
哎哟我去
Uh, Bartles & Jaymes!

246
00:10:27,716 --> 00:10:29,089
那就好 仔细考虑之后
Good. Because we are thinking

247
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:30,520
我们觉得挺想在一个班的
We might want to stay in that class.

248
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:33,420
真的吗 孩子们 我不确定啊
Really? Oh, girls, I don't know about that.

249
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:34,660
拜托了 再给个机会吧
Oh, please let us try it.

250
00:10:34,660 --> 00:10:36,040
超级邓菲无敌档
Super Dunphy?

251
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,300
我抓不住了 抓不住了
I can't hold her! I can't hold her!

252
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,260
好吧 就再待一个星期
Well, maybe one more week.

253
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,860
谢谢 妈妈
Thanks, mom.

254
00:10:46,869 --> 00:10:50,212
好像吃过 一碗汤 一份科布色拉
I don't know. Uh, a cup of soup, a cobb salad.

255
00:10:50,801 --> 00:10:52,522
对 里面有培根
Yeah, it had bacon.

256
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:55,380
小卡 我没时间跟你讲我今天吃了什么
Cam, I don't have all day to describe all my meals to you.

257
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:59,660
别再咬我的东西了 你个愚蠢的畜生
Stop eating all my things, you stupid animal.

258
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:01,300
不是 小卡 我不是在说你
No, Cam, not you.

259
00:11:01,300 --> 00:11:02,120
我回头给你电话
I'll call you back.

260
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:03,900
坏狗狗
Bad doggy!

261
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:05,440
你想咬东西吗
You want to chew on something?

262
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:07,280
行 没问题
Okay. Okay. Okay.

263
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:09,040
看这个
Look at this.

264
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:13,040
看这美味的鞋子 尽情咬吧
Look at this delicious man shoe. Eat it.

265
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:16,000
来吧 咬啊 咬啊
Come on. Eat it. Eat it.

266
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:17,680
很美味的
Mmm! Yummy.

267
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,700
把鞋子吃掉
Eat the shoe.

268
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,860
来嘛 咬这只鞋子
Eat his shoe. Come on. Eat his shoe.

269
00:11:24,432 --> 00:11:26,268
就像这样
Yeah, like this. Look.

270
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:28,700
真好吃
Delicious.

271
00:11:30,180 --> 00:11:30,620
妈妈
Mom?

272
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,920
松口
Drop it.

273
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:38,540
我
I--

274
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:41,180
别说了 抱歉让你看到这一幕
Please. I'm sorry you had to see this.

275
00:11:48,660 --> 00:11:49,100
你好
hello?

276
00:11:49,100 --> 00:11:51,635
邓菲夫人您好 我是校长助理罗丝
Hi, Mrs. Dunphy. This is Rose in the principal's office.

277
00:11:51,635 --> 00:11:54,223
-您方便跟韦勒校长讲话吗 -好的
-Can you hold for principal Weller? -Yes.

278
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,180
你好 克莱尔
Hi, Claire.

279
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:59,860
你好 约翰 她又犯什么事了
Hi, John. What'd she do this time?

280
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:01,980
事实上 她们俩都在我这儿
Actually, I've got both of them in here.

281
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:03,800
她们俩 真的吗
Both of them? Really?

282
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:06,780
艾丽克斯给海莉抄作业
Alex was letting Haley copy her homework.

283
00:12:06,780 --> 00:12:07,780
被沃特斯老师发现了
Mr. Waters caught them.

284
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:09,640
真不敢相信
I-I don't believe it.

285
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:11,080
我会跟她们俩谈谈
I'm about to have a little talk with them,

286
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,880
所以她们会晚一会儿出来
So they'll be out a few minutes late.

287
00:12:12,906 --> 00:12:15,840
约翰 非常抱歉 说句老实话
Um, I'm so sorry, John, and honestly,

288
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,240
我通常不至于如此教导无方 我发誓
I-I really am a better mother than this. I promise.

289
00:12:18,580 --> 00:12:19,500
你以前也这么说过
So you've said.

290
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:23,660
不是吧
Seriously?

291
00:12:24,664 --> 00:12:28,360
不是吧 你
Seriously? Oh. You...

292
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,060
抱歉打扰一下
Excuse me.

293
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:32,600
这是什么鬼东西
Hey, um, what the hell is this?

294
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,600
这片区域仅限上下车
This zone is for loading and unloading,

295
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:35,720
不是用来讲电话的
not for talking on the phone.

296
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:38,020
我知道 但是我是在跟校长讲电话
Yeah, I know, but I was talking on the phone to the school

297
00:12:38,020 --> 00:12:39,920
孩子们就要出来了 所以
that my kids were about to come out of, so...

298
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:42,420
你知道这里有时间限制吗
Are you aware this zone has a time limit?

299
00:12:42,450 --> 00:12:43,872
不 我不知道
N-no, I'm not.

300
00:12:47,140 --> 00:12:48,740
知道不 姐现在还真想发泄几句
You know what? I do want to do some unloading.

301
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:51,260
我了解你这种人
I know your type.

302
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:55,160
你的生活太糟 觉得自己很渺小
Life has been bad to you. It has made you feel small.

303
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:58,660
然后有一天 某人给了你一身山寨警察装
And then one day somebody gives you a fake cop outfit,

304
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:01,380
一个玩具徽章 和一个破领带
A toy badge and a little spongebob tie.

305
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:03,260
你突然就想报复社会了 对不对
Suddenly it's payback time, right?

306
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:05,000
我告诉你
Well, I got news for you,

307
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,020
"法律与秩序：特殊停车警"
"Law & order: Special parking unit,"

308
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,520
我没错
Not my fault.

309
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,860
真对不起 爸爸
I'm really sorry, dad.

310
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,960
没关系的
Oh, it's all right.

311
00:13:18,420 --> 00:13:20,000
在学校吐过的又不止你一个人
Everybody throws up at school.

312
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:22,800
要是我在学校每吐一次能赚五分钱
If I had a nickel for every time I puked at school,

313
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:23,880
你猜我一共能赚多少
you know how much money I'd have?

314
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,320
三十五分钱
35 cents.

315
00:13:25,660 --> 00:13:28,240
没错 去洗洗干净 我马上打给医生
Exactly. Now go get cleaned up, and I'll call the doctor.

316
00:13:29,180 --> 00:13:30,940
爸 等等 我不用医生
Wait, dad, I don't need a doctor.

317
00:13:31,460 --> 00:13:33,540
-怎么了 -前些天
- What's up? - The other day,

318
00:13:33,660 --> 00:13:35,620
米奇尔舅舅送了一大袋垃圾食品过来
Uncle Mitchell brought over a bag of junk food

319
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:37,380
以便他和小卡施行快速减"犹"法
So he and Cam could do a jew fast.

320
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:40,461
-是果汁减"油"吧 -他说的肯定是"减犹"
- Juice fast? - I'm pretty sure he said "Jew".

321
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:44,180
随便吧 我截获下来 藏了起来 全都吃了
But anyway, I took the bag, and I hid it, and I ate it all.

322
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:44,980
不是吧老弟
Oh, buddy.

323
00:13:45,540 --> 00:13:49,220
我情难自禁 我意志薄弱 别鄙视我
I couldn't help myself. I'm weak. Don't look at me.

324
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:50,380
没关系的
It's all right.

325
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:54,360
没事的 你从中获得了教训
It's okay. Hey, you learned a lesson.

326
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:56,420
惨痛的教训
A painful lesson.

327
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,100
我们爷俩都是
I guess we both have.

328
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,540
什么意思
What do you mean?

329
00:14:01,860 --> 00:14:03,300
我一直以为自己是个
I always saw myself as a guy

330
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:05,260
上天入地无所不能的纯爷们
who could soar through the sky, dancing on a wire.

331
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:08,620
可我连离地六英寸的钢丝都走不过
I can't even get across one 6 inches off the ground.

332
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,680
也许这正是问题所在
Well, maybe that's the problem.

333
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:12,680
也许 你之所以会摔倒
Maybe you keep falling

334
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:14,880
是因为你心里觉得摔下来也无大碍
because part of you knows that you can fall.

335
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:19,020
如果钢丝架得很高很高 你就不会摔了
Maybe if the wire was much, much higher, you wouldn't fall.

336
00:14:20,660 --> 00:14:21,940
卢克 卢克 卢克
Oh, Luke, Luke, Luke.

337
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,420
你是个天才
You are a genius.

338
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,140
来吧 咱们有活儿干了
Come on. We got work to do.

339
00:14:27,140 --> 00:14:29,027
太给力了 我能先吃个甜甜圈吗
Yes! Can I have a doughnut first?

340
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:29,740
没问题
Yes, you can!

341
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:34,800
总算出来了 超级邓菲无敌档
Ah, there they are, my super Dunphys.

342
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,500
我们很抱歉 但我们...
We're sorry, but we just--

343
00:14:36,940 --> 00:14:38,180
你没资格解释
You don't get to talk.

344
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:41,980
你们今天原本可以进步一些的
You had a chance to be better people today.

345
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,870
你 可以学会和人相处
You, to be more well-rounded,

346
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,600
而你 可以做个好学生
And you, to be a better student.

347
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:47,840
你们本来能给邓菲家增光的
You could have elevated the Dunphy name,

348
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,960
但恰恰相反 你们却给抹了黑
But instead, you chose to tarnish it,

349
00:14:49,980 --> 00:14:51,840
所以 恭喜二位小姐
So, congratulations, ladies,

350
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,660
你们让家族名誉再次跌得无下限
You brought this family to a new low.

351
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:56,960
妈 你是不是...
Mom, are you--

352
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,700
是的 没错
Yeah. Yeah, I am,

353
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:00,940
可以的话 希望你帮我解开这个
And I would actually like to get these loosened up, if I might.

354
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:03,960
-你以后还继续添乱吗 -绝对不会
- Are we gonna have any more trouble? - No, ma'am.

355
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:05,620
克莱尔 需要我开车送孩子们吗
Oh, Claire, do you need me to drive the girls?

356
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:07,688
没事儿 珍妮特 没事儿
All good, Janet. All good.

357
00:15:09,443 --> 00:15:10,834
尝尝奶酪团子吧
Goat cheese risotto ball?

358
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:12,380
不用了 谢谢
No, thank you.

359
00:15:12,380 --> 00:15:15,080
确定吗 很好吃的哦
Are you sure? They're so good.

360
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:15,760
闪一边儿去
Walk away.

361
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:19,080
就算我精力充沛 也很难控制住小卡
It's tough enough to deal with Cam when I'm at full strength.

362
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:21,580
但我跟他一样经受了"果汁速度减肥法"的摧残
But I have been fasting just as long as he has,

363
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:22,800
所以我也没力气
and I do not have the energy

364
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:25,311
去对付那个可怜的"大怪头"
to deal with a big, needy brisketcase--

365
00:15:25,311 --> 00:15:27,224
大侩...大块头
Brass--basketcase.

366
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:30,880
小卡 别生我的气
Cam! Don't be mad at me,

367
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,640
但你真的得吃点儿东西
But I think that you really need to eat something.

368
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:33,200
什么
What?

369
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,680
你应该支持我的
You're supposed to be my support.

370
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:37,140
离我远点儿 你个狐狸精
Oh, away from me, temptress.

371
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:39,340
以前叫你狐狸精是爱你 现在是真恨你
And I never thought I would call you that in a negative way.

372
00:15:39,712 --> 00:15:41,840
我看她做过很多疯狂的事儿
I've seen her do a lot of crazy stuff,

373
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,540
但此次的疯狂又上升一个等级
But this is a whole new level.

374
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,400
这饼干是给人吃的吗
Is this a people cookie?

375
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:47,100
吃吧 没事儿
You're good.

376
00:15:47,260 --> 00:15:49,240
你只要说"是"或"不是"就行了
A definitive "yes" or "no" would be appreciated.

377
00:15:49,460 --> 00:15:51,000
上次的蛋糕已经给我留下阴影了
Those cupcakes did a number on me.

378
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,540
你高兴了吧
Are you happy?

379
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:58,840
你让我自贱到吃鞋子的地步
You have reduced me to a person who eats a shoe.

380
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:01,080
-歌洛莉亚 坐下 -你觉得很好玩吗
- Gloria, sit. -You think this is funny?

381
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:02,880
把我当狗一样地使唤
To talk to me like I am a dog?

382
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:04,500
我可没有把你当狗一样使唤
I'm not talking to you like you're a dog.

383
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:07,220
我只是请你坐下 好把问题解决了
I'm just asking you to sit so we can get to the bottom of this.

384
00:16:07,700 --> 00:16:08,360
好吧
Okay, fine.

385
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,480
真乖
Good girl.

386
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:12,460
拜托 你自己给我机会的
Come on. You set me up.

387
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:14,180
歌洛莉亚 你为何表现的那么疯狂
Gloria, why are you acting so crazy?

388
00:16:14,300 --> 00:16:15,580
不就是条狗嘛
It's just a little dog.

389
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:17,620
不是狗把我逼疯了
It's not the little dog that is making me crazy.

390
00:16:17,620 --> 00:16:19,060
是你把我逼疯了
It's you that is making me crazy.

391
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:21,460
-我 -没错 你以前把我放在第一位的
- Me? -Yeah, you used to put me first.

392
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:23,280
以前是我陪你洗澡
You used to want me in that shower.

393
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,540
我是不是该"非礼勿听"
Should I be here for this?

394
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:27,842
不用 曼尼 没关系 我走 但我要告诉你
No, Manny. It's okay. I go. But I want you to know this.

395
00:16:27,842 --> 00:16:29,940
在我老家 男人都宠着女人
Where I come from, men cherish woman.

396
00:16:29,940 --> 00:16:32,120
老婆第一 情人第二 狗第三
It goes wife, mistress, dog.

397
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,660
狗永远排在最后
Dog always at the bottom.

398
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:38,100
大伙都知道 我经常被邀请
As you can imagine, I get asked to help,

399
00:16:38,130 --> 00:16:40,360
去帮忙解决些环境问题
Uh, with a lot of these environmental causes.

400
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,800
通常 我只是买张票
Usually, I buy a ticket,

401
00:16:41,800 --> 00:16:44,600
买双奥尼尔的战靴
Uh, bid on Shaquille O'Neal's big shoe...

402
00:16:45,739 --> 00:16:47,444
完事儿就回家了
and, uh, come home.

403
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:51,000
但后来发生了件事儿
But then, something happened.

404
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,360
我爱好腹板冲浪
I love paddle surfing.

405
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:57,780
每次出海 我都能碰到一头海狮
And each time I'd go out, I'd see this one sea lion.

406
00:16:57,780 --> 00:16:59,940
它抬起头 看着我玩
He'd pop his head up. He'd check me out.

407
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:02,660
我都习以为常了 甚至给它起了个名字 斯诺克斯
I got so used to seeing him, I even named him--Snorkels.

408
00:17:02,980 --> 00:17:04,900
天呐 我不喜欢故事的发展路线
Oh, god, I do not like where this is going.

409
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:09,033
有一天 我出海碰到了斯诺克斯
So one day, I, uh, I go out and I see Snorkels.

410
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:12,040
但它在水里奇怪地扭着身体
But he's doing this weird twisting thing in the water.

411
00:17:12,220 --> 00:17:13,800
苍天呐 天呐 天呐
Oh, god. Oh, god. Oh, god.

412
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:19,560
于是我划过去 发现有个塑料袋
So I paddle over, and I see he's got a plastic grocery bag,

413
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:22,280
将他的脖子和鳍勒在一起
wrapped around his neck and one of his fins.

414
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:25,900
我慌了 想方设法用船桨去帮他扯开
And I freaked, tried to get it off with my paddle.

415
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:28,128
但那不管用 于是我跳下水
It didn't work, so I-I jumped in,

416
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:33,220
可惜的是他已经沉入水中 之后
But he disappeared under the water. And, uh...

417
00:17:33,220 --> 00:17:34,940
别说了 求你别说下去了
Don't say it. Don't you dare say it.

418
00:17:35,120 --> 00:17:37,660
之后我就再也没见到他
And I never saw him again.

419
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:41,520
绝对是我听过的最悲伤的故事
This is the saddest thing I've ever--

420
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:45,200
米奇尔 你没事吧
Mitchell, are you okay?

421
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,280
怎么可能没事
Of course I'm not okay.

422
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:50,100
一切都那么糟糕郁闷
None of this is okay.

423
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,880
好吧 你得忍住了
Okay, well, you need to pull yourself together.

424
00:17:51,915 --> 00:17:53,467
我们正在你老板家呢
'cause we're at your boss' house.

425
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,380
他淹死了 小卡
He drowned, Cam!

426
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:57,460
他没事吧
Is he all right?

427
00:17:57,560 --> 00:17:59,300
没事 没事 我觉得他需要点新鲜空气
Yeah, yeah, I just think he needs a little air.

428
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,800
你知道谁还需要新鲜空气吗
You know who else needed air?

429
00:18:02,900 --> 00:18:03,340
斯诺克斯
Snorkels!

430
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:05,260
抱歉
Excuse me.

431
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:10,160
斯诺克斯 你在哪里 斯诺克斯
Snorkels?! Where are you, Snorkels?!

432
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,880
米奇尔 快回来
Mitchell, get back here!

433
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,280
噢 斯诺克斯
Oh, Snorkels!

434
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:15,200
米奇尔 你这是怎么了
Mitchell, what is wrong with you?!

435
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:17,240
你以为我怎么了 我饿坏了
What do you think is wrong with me? I'm starving!

436
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:20,560
好吧 如果你饿了 就吃些东西吧
Well, if you're starving, then just eat something!

437
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:24,060
我不能吃东西 因为你会生我的气
I can't eat something because then you'll get mad at me,

438
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:25,720
而且我们现在在我老板家
And we're at my boss' house!

439
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,680
我不会生你的气
I'm not gonna get mad at you!

440
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:30,140
我很感谢你为我做的一切
I appreciate what you're doing for me!

441
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,740
我所做的一切也都是为了你
I'm doing it for you.

442
00:18:31,740 --> 00:18:33,440
不 你不需要为我减肥
Oh, you don't have to do anything for me.

443
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,660
我就喜欢原原本本真实的你
I love you just the way you are.

444
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,640
我也喜欢原原本本真实的你
I love you just the way you are.

445
00:18:41,919 --> 00:18:43,351
-我抓住你了 -好 好
- I got you! - Okay. Okay.

446
00:18:43,351 --> 00:18:44,180
-我抓住你了 亲爱的 -谢谢
- I got you, babe! - Thank you.

447
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:45,080
我抓住你了
I got you!

448
00:18:45,850 --> 00:18:47,000
-小卡 -我抓住你了
- Cam. - I got you!

449
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,580
脚能够到地 我自己站起来
I can walk. I can walk.

450
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:51,900
或许跟米奇尔只能做同事 无法做朋友
I think Mitchell may just be a work friend.

451
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:02,040
今天我让爸妈失望了 更糟糕的是
I let down my Mom and Dad today, and... Worse than that,

452
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:03,420
我也让老师失望了
I let down my teacher.

453
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:05,180
都是我的错
It's all my fault.

454
00:19:05,365 --> 00:19:07,340
跟我沾边的都得挨罚
Everything I touch turns to detention.

455
00:19:07,340 --> 00:19:08,680
对不起 妈妈
I'm sorry, Mom.

456
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:10,100
我也是
Me, too.

457
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,740
算了吧 我今天也没法
Oh, I don't really have

458
00:19:12,740 --> 00:19:14,720
站在什么道德高度上去说教你们了
a whole lot of moral high ground to stand on.

459
00:19:14,746 --> 00:19:17,720
我自己也搞砸了
I wasn't exactly my best self today either.

460
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:20,880
总之 今天邓菲家族集体触霉头
All in all, not a great day for the Dunphys.

461
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:24,380
加油老爸 相信你自己
Come on, Dad! Believe in yourself!

462
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:27,060
你让一切不可能变得可能
You're making the impossible unimpossible.

463
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:30,260
菲尔 天呐
Phil. Oh, my god.

464
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:32,640
你省省吧 他正"闭关"练功呢
Don't even bother. He's in the zone.

465
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:33,880
他听不见你
He can't hear you.

466
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:34,920
加油 爸爸
Go, Dad!

467
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:36,160
你能行的
You got this!

468
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:41,360
一周来 我教育女儿都是在空口说白话
All week long, I'd been telling my girls how to act

469
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:42,640
而不是言传身教
instead of showing them.

470
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:44,040
但菲尔不是
But not Phil.

471
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:46,000
菲尔本可以说
Phil could have said,

472
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:48,980
艾丽克斯 放松点 别什么事都太较真
"Alex, relax. Don't take everything so seriously."

473
00:19:49,220 --> 00:19:52,240
或者 海莉 尝试挑战 别轻易放弃
Or "Haley, challenge yourself. Don't give up so easily."

474
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:56,360
但菲尔没有选择言语教导 而是采取实际行动
But instead of talking the talk, Phil walked the walk.

475
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:59,220
这难道不正是我们应该
And isn't that what we're supposed to do

476
00:19:59,220 --> 00:20:00,400
为所爱之人做的吗
for the people we love?

477
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:07,780
虽然是个挑战
It's definitely a challenge...

478
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:13,120
但菲尔让它看起来很简单
But Phil made it look easy,

479
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:15,358
七尺之上
7 feet off the ground.

480
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:19,680
你太棒了
You're awesome!

481
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:21,040
天呐 我做到了
Oh, my goodness!

482
00:20:21,719 --> 00:20:24,347
原来 超级邓菲一直都在我身边
Turns out, I've had my super Dunphy all along.

483
00:20:27,383 --> 00:20:28,004
我知道
Oh, I know.

484
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:31,800
我走钢丝的时候脑子里想着什么
What was on my mind as I was walking across that wire?

485
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:35,720
我一直在想 如果我能走钢丝
I kept thinking, if I can do this,

486
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:39,880
我就有两种方式穿过我家院子了
Then I've got two ways of getting across my yard.

487
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:44,200
你玩得高兴吗
Did you have fun?

488
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:47,900
嗯 她是世界上最可爱的狗狗
Yes. She's the cutest dog in the whole world.

489
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,120
够了 你第一次说的时候我就听见了
Yeah, I heard you the first time.

490
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,520
我们去找你爸爸们吧
Let's go find your Daddies.

491
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:52,863
我们在这儿呢
We're in here!

492
00:20:53,495 --> 00:20:55,960
天呐 蛋糕真是太好吃了
Oh, my god. These cupcakes a so good.

493
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:57,020
抱歉 我们自己拿着吃了
I'm so sorry. We helped ourselves.

494
00:20:57,100 --> 00:20:59,080
我们太饿了 这些蛋糕太美味了
We were so hungry. They are delicious.

495
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:01,520
话说我很喜欢甜而不腻的口味
I love that they're not too sweet, you know?

496
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,160
吃起来有点像小馅饼
They taste almost like pate.

497
00:21:04,460 --> 00:21:05,220
我的意思是说
You know, I mean...

498
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,760
你们怎么吃东西了
But why are you eating?

499
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:08,520
我们之前在节食减肥呢
We've been on a juice cleanse.

500
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:10,340
你先自己一边儿玩去吧 亲爱的
You need to mind your own business, sweetie, for right now.
